# Model dispatcher config — TEMPLATE.
#
# 1. Copy this file to common/configs/model.yml.
# 2. Fill in real api_key + api_base values for each profile you actually use.
# 3. NEVER commit common/configs/model.yml — it is git-ignored.
#
# Tip: keep secrets in a private password manager and inject via your shell
# (e.g., direnv) so this file only references env vars where possible.

